    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_s_mat",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 178,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "glm::mat4 transA(1.0f)\ntransA = glm::rotate(transA, angle, vec3(0,0,1))\ntransA = glm::translate(transA, vec3(0.5,-0.5,0))\n→ 先旋转再平移 = 绕自身轴转",
